  "jobTitle": "Founder and Web Developer",
  "summary": "Send Social Media brings together Social Media, Email and SMS technologies to help grow your business, monitor your brand and track results. \n\nSend Social Media is an online marketing service for businesses and marketers to promote, grow and track their brands through the use of Social Media, Email and SMS messaging. Send Social Media is the easiest way to grow and build your brand online and is a one-stop-shop for all your marketing needs.\n\nSOCIAL MEDIA MARKETING\n\nSend Social Media is at the cutting edge of Social Media and we understand how Social Media can help draw traffic to your site and enhance your online presence. Here are some of the things you can do with Send Social Media:\n\nPost to multiple services at once\nPost messages to over 30+ social networks and many more being added all the time. We support multiple accounts for each service.\n\nSchedule your social network updates\nPlan ahead and schedule your status updates to be posted at the time you choose or set updates to go off at recurring schedules.\n\nBulk and group messaging\nSend Social Media makes it easy to send out bulk messages to all your contacts across all social networks at once. E.g. you might want to broadcast a message by posting to walls of all your friends at once.\n\nUse Send Social Media analytics to track the success of your posts\nSend Social Media tracks all the messages you send across all the services you're posting to. Use Send Social Media to keep track of likes, shares, views, clicks, referring sites etc.\n\nRead and respond to comments on your Social Network posts\nSend Social Media pulls in any responses from your Social Media messages and displays them to you in your Message Box. You can respond to comments directly from Send Social Media.",
